# Estimates keyboards — LOCKED (reviewed Sep 2026)

Same contract as the rest of the app: **blue checkmark**, **no Done bar** above the keyboard. Unless the user explicitly asks to change a **specific** field:

- Do **not** add `KeyboardPlainAccessory`, `KeyboardDoneAccessory`, or `inputAccessoryViewID` on text fields
- Do **not** bulk-refactor `keyboardType` / `returnKeyType` / accessory props across steps
- Do **not** reintroduce green/grey Done strips or global `bpsKeyboardDone` on text inputs

## Shared helpers (same as Projects)

| Use case | Helper |
|---|---|
| Step 1–2 labeled fields | `AppTextField` (applies `resolveTextInputKeyboardProps` internally) |
| Line-item modal text fields | `{...resolveTextInputKeyboardProps()}` or `{ multiline: true }` spread **last** |
| Phone / ZIP / sqft / modal amounts | `keyboardType` + `estimateStep12NumericKeyboardProps` or `lineItemModalNumericKeyboardProps` (= `nativeNumericKeyboardProps`, **no accessory**) |
| Main scroll (iOS) | `estimatesMainScrollIosProps`: `automaticallyAdjustKeyboardInsets` + `keyboardDismissMode: 'none'` |

## iOS mounts — current (do not add accessories)

| Area | Rule |
|---|---|
| Steps 1–2 main screen | **No** `KeyboardPlainAccessory` — removed; was breaking blue checkmark on Email / Customer Name |
| Line-item modal (Add Labor / Add Materials) | **No** `KeyboardPlainAccessory` |
| Step 5 decimals | `step5EquipmentPlain` empty accessory **only** if already mounted for step 5–7 decimal pads — do not extend to text fields |
| Step 3 cart qty | Native `phone-pad` only when line-item modal is closed |

## By step

| Step | Text fields | Numeric fields |
|------|-------------|----------------|
| **1** Customer | `AppTextField` — name, email, address, city, state, company, notes | Phone, ZIP: `phone-pad` + `estimateStep12NumericKeyboardProps` |
| **2** Project | `AppTextField` — title, description | Square footage: `phone-pad` + `estimateStep12NumericKeyboardProps` |
| **3–4** Modals | `resolveTextInputKeyboardProps` on labor/material text inputs | `lineItemModalNumericKeyboardProps` on amount/rate/sqft |
| **5** Direct costs | N/A | `decimal-pad` + `step5EquipmentPlain` (existing step-5 contract only) |
| **7** Payments | N/A | `phone-pad` + `step5EquipmentPlain` for custom week/milestone counts |

## Before committing a keyboard change in this file

```bash
# Must be zero after a text-field fix (unless step 5–7 decimal-only accessory):
rg 'KeyboardPlainAccessory|bpsKeyboardDone|inputAccessoryViewID' estimate-generator.jsx
```

Confirm unrelated steps were not touched.
